#. え…？　何これ…？
msgctxt "0001 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "The hell...?"
msgstr ""

#. 江ノ島盾子…あなたの負けよ。
msgctxt "0002 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You've lost, Junko."
msgstr ""

#. 負け……？
msgctxt "0003 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I lost?"
msgstr ""

#. 負けた…？　アタシが…？
#. そ、そんな……
msgctxt "0004 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I...lost? Me...? N-No way..."
msgstr ""

#. そんなのってぇぇええッ！！
msgctxt "0005 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It can't beeeeee!"
msgstr ""

#. み、認めねーつもりか…？
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Y-You still don't accept it...?"
msgstr ""

#. さすがの“超高校級の絶望”も、
#. 自分を襲う絶望には弱いか…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Even the Ultimate Despair herself is vulnerable to the\n"
"onslaught of despair, it would seem."
msgstr ""

#. でも、どんな抵抗をしたって無駄だよ！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "But there's no use trying to fight it now!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなのってぇぇぇぇええええッ！！
msgctxt "0009 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Well that's juuuuusst...!"
msgstr ""

#. …最高じゃない！！
msgctxt "0010 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Totally the best!"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Hả?"

#. これが…これが絶望なのね…！
msgctxt "0012 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "This...this is despair...!"
msgstr ""

#. ２年も前から…この学園に乗り込んで…
#. 綿密な計画を練り上げて…
msgctxt "0013 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"We came to this school two years ago, created our\n"
"incredibly detailed plan..."
msgstr ""

#. そして、計画の為に、
#. 実の姉まで殺したって言うのに…
msgctxt "0014 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I even killed my own sister for it..."
msgstr ""

#. それなのに、最後の最後で失敗するなんてッ！
msgctxt "0015 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "To come this far, and fail at the very end...!"
msgstr ""

#. これ以上ないほどの超絶望だわッ！！
msgctxt "0016 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "It's the most ultimately ultimate despair!"
msgstr ""

#. な、何…言ってるんだよ…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about...?"
msgstr "C-Cậu đang nói gì vậy...?"

#. アタシは、絶望的に絶望的だったの！
#. 生まれた瞬間にすべてに飽きてたの！
msgctxt "0018 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Don't you see? I was so hopelessly desperate! I was\n"
"bored of the world the moment I was born!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、ずっと楽しみにしてたのよ…
#. 人生で１度きりの…このイベント…
msgctxt "0019 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"That's why I've been looking forward to this so\n"
"desperately. This once-in-a-lifetime experience..."
msgstr ""

#. 最初で最後の最大の絶望！　死の瞬間！！
msgctxt "0020 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"It is my first and last colossal despair, here at the\n"
"moment of death!"
msgstr ""

#. それを、“計画の失敗”という
#. 最高級の絶望の中で味わえるなんて…
msgctxt "0021 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"To have the chance to taste of the highest grade\n"
"despair—the utter failure of my dreams!"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ！　絶望的に幸せだわ！！
msgctxt "0022 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ahhh! I am so hopelessly happy right now!"
msgstr ""

#. なんか…喜んでない…？
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Wait, is she...enjoying this?"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく…負けを認めるって事でいいのね？
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Anyway, so are you prepared to admit defeat?"
msgstr ""

#. アハ…アハハハハッ！！
#. 負けとか…そんなの別にどっちでもいいし！
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Haha...hahahahaaahahaaa! You think I care whether I\n"
"won or lost?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、オマエラが勝とうが負けようが、
#. 結局は一緒なんだもん…
msgctxt "0026 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Either way, it doesn't change a thing!"
msgstr ""

#. 外も絶望、中も絶望！
#. あんたらには絶望しかないんだから！
msgctxt "0027 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Outside is only despair, inside is only despair!\n"
"No matter where you go, despair awaits you!"
msgstr ""

#. ち、違う…そんな事……
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Th-That's not true..."
msgstr ""

#. …そんな事はない！
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You're wrong!"
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. 言っておくが、今の俺達は、
#. もう絶望など恐れていない。
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Let me tell you this right now. We no longer fear\n"
"despair."
msgstr ""

#. だって、私達は<CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>を持って、
#. 外に出ていく決心をしたんだもん！
msgctxt "0032 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Because we've decided to enter the outside world with\n"
"<CLT 3>hope<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. そこの苗木っちに、そそのかされちまってな！
msgctxt "0033 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Yeah, Makoto totally seduced us over to his side!"
msgstr ""

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0034 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahaha!"
msgstr "Kyeeehahaha!"

#. み、みんな…！
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "E-Everyone...!"
msgstr ""

#. …江ノ島盾子、あなたは言ってたわね。
#. 絶望は伝染して広まるって…
msgctxt "0036 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "You said that despair is as contagious as any disease."
msgstr ""

#. でも…それは希望だって一緒よ。
msgctxt "0037 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "But the same is true of hope."
msgstr ""

#. 今の私達を見れば、それがわかるはずよ？
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"All you have to do is look at us to see how true that\n"
"is."
msgstr ""

#. き、霧切さん…！！
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko!"
msgstr "K-Kyoko!"

#. ………………
msgctxt "0040 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あー、イヤだイヤだ！
#. 私の大嫌いな顔がいっぱいじゃない！
msgctxt "0041 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Ahh, stop it! Stop! I hate those faces you're making!"
msgstr ""

#. これ以上、そんな顔を見てるのは、
#. 苦痛以外の何物でもないけど…
msgctxt "0042 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "To see those awful looks causes me nothing but pain..."
msgstr ""

#. …でも、最後に１つだけ。
msgctxt "0043 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Fine, let me just say one last thing..."
msgstr ""

#. オマエラが、あくまで<CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>にこだわるなら、
#. それはそれで構わないけどさ…
msgctxt "0044 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"If you guys wanna get all hung up on the word <CLT 3>hope<CLT>,\n"
"that's no skin off my nose..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、覚悟しておきなよ…
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "But just be warned..."
msgstr ""

#. これから先、オマエラの前には、
#. 次々と<CLT 3>“絶望”<CLT>が立ちはだかる事になるよ。
msgctxt "0046 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"From this point on, one <CLT 3>despair<CLT> after another will\n"
"stand in your way."
msgstr ""

#. どこへ進もうと…どこへ逃げようともね…
msgctxt "0047 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "No matter where you run, no matter where you hide..."
msgstr ""

#. 裏と表…だけど紙一重…
#. 希望があるところには必ず絶望もあるんだよ。
msgctxt "0048 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Maybe you'll find some hope, but there is a very fine\n"
"line dividing that hope from bitter despair."
msgstr ""

#. それでも、オマエラは、
#. 希望を持ち続けていられるかしらん？
msgctxt "0049 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Knowing that, you still plan to cling to your hope?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、当たり前だ…
#. だって、ボク達は…
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Of course! Because we—"
msgstr ""

#. いいんだって！　今のは単なる独り言！
#. だから、答える必要なんてないの！
msgctxt "0051 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Shut up, shut up! That was a rhetorical question. You\n"
"interrupted my monologue!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、その独り言も、もうお終い…
msgctxt "0052 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I'm almost done though, so whatever..."
msgstr ""

#. だって、そろそろ<CLT 3>“おしおき”<CLT>の時間…でしょ！？
msgctxt "0053 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Because it's almost <CLT 3>punishment time<CLT>, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. あなたは…自分まで処刑するつもりなの…？
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Do you really intend to go through with this?"
msgstr ""

#. そういうルールだったはずでしょ？
msgctxt "0055 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "That was the agreement, right?"
msgstr ""

#. ま、待てよ…！
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "H-Hold on!"
msgstr "K-Khoan đã!"

#. ボクは別に…お前に死んでもらおうなんて…！
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's not like I *want* you to die! You don't have to—"
msgstr ""

#. やめてやめてやめてやめてッ！！
msgctxt "0058 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Stop it stop it stop it STOP IT!"
msgstr ""

#. …えっ！？
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cái gì!?"

#. さっきから言ってるじゃない！
msgctxt "0060 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "How many times do I have to tell you!?"
msgstr ""

#. アタシは、生きる事に<CLT 3>“希望”<CLT>なんて持ってないの！
msgctxt "0061 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "The act of living brings me <CLT 3>no hope<CLT> at all!"
msgstr ""

#. むしろ…人生で１度しか味わえない<CLT 3>“死の絶望”<CLT>を、
#. これから楽しもうとしているんだから…
msgctxt "0062 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"All I want now is to taste that <CLT 3>despair of death<CLT>\n"
"that you only get once in life. So..."
msgstr ""

#. ジャマしないでよぉぉぉぉッ！！
msgctxt "0063 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Don't get in my way!"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…うぷぷぷ…！
msgctxt "0064 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu... Puhuhuhu!"
msgstr ""

#. あぁ、素敵だわ…
#. これが<CLT 3>死の絶望<CLT>なのね…！
msgctxt "0065 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"So this is how the <CLT 3>despair of death<CLT> feels... Ahh,\n"
"it's so wonderful!"
msgstr ""

#. この絶望の１０分の１でも…
#. １００分の１でも…！
msgctxt "0066 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Even a tenth of this despair... Even a hundredth...!"
msgstr ""

#. 世界中のみんなに、
#. もっと味わって欲しかった…！
msgctxt "0067 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I want every last soul on this planet to taste such\n"
"despair!"
msgstr ""

#. 世界中を、この素晴らしい絶望に染め上げたかった！
msgctxt "0068 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"I want the entire world to die with that despair in\n"
"its mouth!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ！　始めるよ！
msgctxt "0069 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Okay, let's do this!"
msgstr ""

#. 最後にふさわしいスペシャルなおしおき！！
msgctxt "0070 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I've reserved an extra special punishment for last!"
msgstr ""

#. では張り切っていきましょう！　おしおきターイム！
msgctxt "0071 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Let's give it everything we've got! It's...PUNISHMENT\n"
"TIIIME!"
msgstr ""
"Mọi người cùng cố gắng hết mình nào! Đã đến... \n"
"GIỜ HÀNH QUYYYẾT!"

#. アーッハッハッハッハッハッハッハ！！
msgctxt "0072 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Haahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こうして終わった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that's how everything came to an end...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>最後の学級裁判も…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The final class trial...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“超高校級の絶望”江ノ島盾子も…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Junko Enoshima, the Ultimate Despair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>希望ヶ峰学園での生活も…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Life at Hope's Peak Academy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…すべてが終わったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was all over.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 3>“モノクマのヘアゴム”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得しました。
#. プレゼントメニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You received the <CLT><CLT 3>Monokuma Hairtie<CLT><CLT 23> present.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
